  "category": "finance",
  "title_zh": "国际评级公司惠誉提高六家国有大银行的评级",
  "title_en": "Rating firm Fitch raises the ratings of six big state-owned banks",
  "paragraphs": [
    {
      "zh": "10月27日，国际评级公司惠誉公布了对六家中国大型国有银行的新评级。这六家银行是工商银行、农业银行、中国银行、建设银行、交通银行和邮储银行。",
      "en": "On October 27, the international rating firm Fitch announced new ratings for six large Chinese state-owned banks. The six banks are the Industrial and Commercial Bank of China, the Agricultural Bank of China, the Bank of China, the China Construction Bank, the Bank of Communications and the Postal Savings Bank of China."
    },
    {
      "zh": "惠誉说，它们的长期外币评级还是“A”，前景稳定。不过，它们的“生存力评级”都提高了。工商银行、农业银行、中国银行和建设银行从“bbb”升到“bbb+”，邮储银行从“bbb-”升到“bbb”，交通银行从“bb+”升到“bbb-”。",
      "en": "Fitch said their long-term foreign-currency rating is still “A” with a stable outlook. However, all of their “viability ratings” went up. The Industrial and Commercial Bank, the Agricultural Bank, the Bank of China and the Construction Bank moved from “bbb” to “bbb+”, the Postal Savings Bank moved from “bbb-” to “bbb”, and the Bank of Communications moved from “bb+” to “bbb-”."
    },
    {
      "zh": "生存力评级是看银行自己的经营情况，不看政府会不会帮忙。同一天，惠誉还把中国银行业的经营环境分数从“bbb-”提高到“bbb”。",
      "en": "A viability rating looks at how a bank itself is run, not at whether the government would help it. On the same day, Fitch also raised its score for the operating environment of China's banking industry from “bbb-” to “bbb”."
    },
    {
      "zh": "惠誉说了几个原因：监管更严，影子银行的风险变小了；2026年上半年，银行贷款增长放慢到5%；农业银行和中国银行还得到了国家注资。今年9月，标普也提高了对中国银行业的风险评估。",
      "en": "Fitch gave several reasons: regulation is tighter and the risk from shadow banking has become smaller; in the first half of 2026, bank loan growth slowed to 5%; and the Agricultural Bank and the Bank of China also received capital from the state. In September this year, S&P also raised its risk assessment of China's banking industry."
    }
  ],
